#: geohatllm.php:273
msgid "Known AI Bots"
msgstr "已知AI机器人"

#: geohatllm.php:274
msgid "Select allowed User-Agents that can access special content for LLM."
msgstr "选择可以访问LLM特殊内容的允许User-Agent。"

