msgid "Grok"
msgstr "Grok"

#: geohatllm.php:290
msgid "Custom Bots"
msgstr "自定义机器人"

#: geohatllm.php:291
msgid "Enter one User-Agent per line:"
msgstr "每行输入一个User-Agent："

#: geohatllm.php:296
msgid "Content visible only to users"
msgstr "仅对用户可见的内容"

#: geohatllm.php:297
msgid "How to hide content from bots?"
msgstr "如何对机器人隐藏内容？"

#: geohatllm.php:298
msgid ""
"The selected options above will allow you to show content only to LLM bots."
msgstr "上述选定的选项将允许您仅向LLM机器人显示内容。"

#: geohatllm.php:299
msgid ""
"However, you can also do the opposite: show content to everyone except "
"selected bots."
msgstr "但是，您也可以做相反的事情：向除选定机器人之外的所有人显示内容。"

#: geohatllm.php:301
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You can hide any block, section or module from selected user-agents by "
"simply adding %1$s as an attribute or the class %2$s to its HTML."
msgstr "您可以通过简单地将 %1$s 添加为属性或将类 %2$s 添加到其HTML中，从而对选定的user-agent隐藏任何块、部分或模块。"

#: geohatllm.php:306
msgid "from block tab (Geohat Options)"
msgstr "从块选项卡 (Geohat选项)"

#: geohatllm.php:307
msgid "Advanced tab → after \"CSS Classes\""
msgstr "高级选项卡 → \"CSS类\"之后"

#: geohatllm.php:308
msgid "More tools → Formats → Hide from bots"
msgstr "更多工具 → 格式 → 对机器人隐藏"

#: geohatllm.php:309
msgid "Any editor"
msgstr "任何编辑器"

#: geohatllm.php:309
msgid "Add the class or attribute manually"
msgstr "手动添加类或属性"

#: geohatllm.php:311
msgid ""
"If the bot matches one of the selected user-agents, this content will not be "
"shown."
msgstr "如果机器人匹配选定的user-agent之一，则不会显示此内容。"

#: geohatllm.php:314
msgid "Disable Cache"
msgstr "禁用缓存"

#: geohatllm.php:315
msgid ""
"Enable this option only if you use WP Rocket, LiteSpeed or other systems "
"that cache HTML and you do not see the plugin working."
msgstr "仅当您使用WP Rocket、LiteSpeed或其他缓存HTML的系统且未看到插件工作时，才启用此选项。"

#: geohatllm.php:316
msgid "Disable cache for these bots"
msgstr "对这些机器人禁用缓存"

#: geohatllm.php:321
msgid "Remove ChatGPT traces"
msgstr "移除ChatGPT痕迹"

#: geohatllm.php:322
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to remove invisible HTML attributes used by "
"LLM tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Bard, etc. Attributes removed:"
msgstr "如果您想移除ChatGPT、Claude、Bard等LLM工具使用的不可见HTML属性，请启用此选项。移除的属性："

#: geohatllm.php:325
msgid "Remove ChatGPT traces from your content"
msgstr "从您的内容中移除ChatGPT痕迹"

